OL,3,GNEWSAVillage remembers snowstorm crash
OL,4,Apilot
OL,5,
OL,6,FA memorial has been unveiled to a
OL,7,Fmuch-loved RAF fighter pilot who died
OL,8,Fwhen his aircraft crashed during a
OL,9,Fsnowstorm in Scotland.
OL,11,FFlying Officer Andrew Crowther, 25, was
OL,12,Ftaking part in an exercise over
OL,13,FLossiemouth on 18 November 1981 when
OL,14,Ftragedy struck.
OL,16,FOn Saturday, a ceremony took place in
OL,17,Fthe airman's home village of Wales, in
OL,18,FRotherham.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
