OL,3,GNEWSAVillage remembers snowstorm crash
OL,4,Apilot
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough his name could not be engraved
OL,7,Fon the village's war memorial because
OL,8,Fhe did not die in active conflict, the
OL,9,Fmemorial - funded by Wales Parish
OL,10,FCouncil - has been placed adjacent to
OL,11,Fit.
